### ReiDoMU::Timing ###
	WarningTime/EventTime in minutes - how long before start the
	warning fires, and how long the event runs.

### ReiDoMU::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### ReiDoMU::GuildReward ###
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winning guild.

### ReiDoMU::CharReward ###
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winning
	character.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<ReiDoMU>
	<Timing WarningTime="5" EventTime="30" />

	<Schedule>
		<StartTime Year="-1" Month="-1" Day="-1" DayOfWeek="-1" Hour="22" Minute="5" Second="0" />
	</Schedule>

	<GuildReward WC="10" WP="0" GP="0" />
	<CharReward WC="8" WP="0" GP="0" />
</ReiDoMU>
